title: Check a plan's words before the run
pid: e232eced-f24a-4310-81a6-6ee9c1ece0ee
body: |2-
  A plan's vocabulary section lists the words it uses. Before the
  run, check each against the glossary and the code. "Hidden",
  "ladder", "merge" and "extent" were coined or overloaded in plan
  04.1's own text, and the agents followed it; the two-question
  check after a plan cannot undo a plan's word. Coining a word is
  fine when the plan says so at first use; reusing one that means
  something else is not.
